this Supplemental Agreement, the other terms and definitions of the Original Agreement shall remain in effect; in the event of any inconsistency
between this Supplemental Agreement and the Original Agreement, this Supplemental Agreement shall prevail in respect of the matters covered
by it.</FONT></P>

